HENK: nothing is linked to this hostname.

henk answered, so the stack is up — it just has no project registered under
this name. Every *.{{TLD}} name resolves to henk whether or not it's linked,
so the hostname working proves nothing.

  1. A typo in the hostname.
     `henk status` lists every linked project and the .{{TLD}} host it
     answers on.

  2. The project was never linked.
     Run `henk link` in the project directory. For an extra hostname on an
     already-linked project:
     henk link --add --host <sub> --port <port>

`henk status` shows what's linked and where it points.
